@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT
@contentType = application/json

### List users (search/filter/sort)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=10&search=&status=active&subscription=subscribed&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=DESC
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Update user status (ban/unban)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/REPLACE_USER_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "banned"
}

### Publish newsletter
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/newsletter/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "subject": "Platform Update",
  "message": "Hello subscribers,\nWe have shipped new features."
}
